flowchart TB
    A[User Action] --> B[Decision Context]
    B --> C[Implied Promise]
    C --> D[Semantic State]
    D --> E[System of Record Snapshot]
    E --> F[Policy Version]
    F --> G[Evidence Sources]
    G --> H{Human Approval Needed?}
    H -- Yes --> I[Approval Role + Timestamp]
    H -- No --> J[Decision Outcome]
    I --> J
    J --> K[Reversal / Compensation Link]
    K --> L[Decision Replay Card]
